<p>Hello {{ display_name }},</p>
<p>We received a request to reset your password.</p>
<p><a href="{{ action_url }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background-color:#1d4ed8;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;">Choose a new password</a></p>
<p>If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser:<br>{{ action_url }}</p>
<p>The link works once and expires in {{ expires_in_minutes }} minutes. If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email; your password stays as it is.</p>
